l/general-onyx-path-discussion/1500517-welcome-to-the-new-forums?p=1501024#post1501024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, do we think all orange means more reputation, or less? None of the boxes are lit up under my name. Hmm...</div> </div> </div> </div>Quite possibly it's disabled. Go to settings, then account, it should be in there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-22T14:44:03-08:00","id":1501065,"title":"","content":"Also, as I understand it, the reputation system isn't fully enabled on the forums anyway (probably for the best). So basically everyone has the same reputation and either it's grey because the display for that user is disabled, or full because the display is enabled (there is mouse over text that will display &quot;has reputation disabled&quot; or &quot;reputation0&quot;).<br /> <br /> The forum software supports a more robust reputation system where users can be awarded/docked reputation (either by selection forum members, or by every user) as something beyond getting likes for a post. However very few people really use that sort of thing because such popularity contests tend to skew behavior and interactions in negative ways rather than helping foster more community goodwill..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-22T16:22:12-08:00","id":1501076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/1500517-welcome-to-the-new-forums?p=1501039#post1501039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quite possibly it's disabled. Go to settings, then account, it should be in there.</div> </div> </div> </div>You were right, that did it! Thanks for pointing me in the right direction!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/1500517-welcome-to-the-new-forums?p=1501065#post1501065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, as I understand it, the reputation system isn't fully enabled on the forums anyway (probably for the best). So basically everyone has the same reputation and either it's grey because the display for that user is disabled, or full because the display is enabled (there is mouse over text that will display &quot;has reputation disabled&quot; or &quot;reputation0&quot;).<br /> <br /> The forum software supports a more robust reputation system where users can be awarded/docked reputation (either by selection forum members, or by every user) as something beyond getting likes for a post. However very few people really use that sort of thing because such popularity contests tend to skew behavior and interactions in negative ways rather than helping foster more community goodwill..</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting... But, I can see why they might not fully enable it...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-01T03:08:20-08:00","id":1501859,"title":"","content":"Is there some specific reason my posts are getting flagged as spam? I've only made 8 posts since the forums came back and at least 2 of them have needed manual moderator approval.<br /> <br /> EDIT: OK just saw this mentioned as a known issue in the trouble tickets, so never mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2433,"user_link":"https://forum.